<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22541" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνώστ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one
				that knows</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐθῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					26.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ εὐαγγελίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Sammelb.</u>
					421.1
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>: esp.<i>one who knows the future,
			diviner</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				28.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνωστήρ</span>
			, <i>surety</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. τῆς πίστεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Flam.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			; <i>expert witness</i> or <i>valuer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLips.
				106.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
